{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013gmbqghpQc7uf4tquP5hfx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心贡献从 ''importance-specific phase interaction'' reframe 为 ''phase-dependent\n2\t  compound severity is a universal phenomenon whose magnitude scales with eviction\n3\t  method discriminativeness''。GPQA 结果证实 random 在长推理链 benchmark 上同样产生强 phase gradient（imp/rand\n4\t  ratio ≈ 1.5-2.0×，复现 LLaMA 模式）， 审稿人认为这削弱了 \"importance-specific\" 的核心 claim。Recency\n5\t  null 被解读为 recency 本身是温和策略（保留 temporal locality），而非证明 scoring-specificity。 新叙事：任何\n6\t  non-trivial eviction 都产生 phase-dependent compound severity， severity magnitude 与\n7\t  eviction discriminativeness 正相关（importance > random >> recency≈null）， 这是 quantitative\n8\t  scaling law 而非 qualitative dissociation。 仍可投 EMNLP 但需重写 intro/framing，novelty claim\n9\t  从 ''dissociation discovery'' 降为 ''scaling law quantification''。\n10\t\n11\t  '\n12\timagined_experiments:\n13\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n14\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n15\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.20, 198 problems, quantile\n16\t    phase segmentation\n17\t  expected_results:\n18\t    n_problems: 198\n19\t    high_median_ii: 0.035\n20\t    mid_median_ii: 0.28\n21\t    low_median_ii: 1.85\n22\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.82\n23\t    ci_95:\n24\t    - 1.45\n25\t    - 2.25\n26\t    wilcoxon_p: 3.2e-28\n27\t    cohens_dz: 0.72\n28\t    monotonic: true\n29\t    low_high_ratio: 52.9\n30\t    dose_response_vs_s015: 1.82 vs 0.95 (1.9× increase)\n31\t  result_rationale: 'GPQA 的推理链比 MATH-500 更长且更异质（跨物理/化学/生物），phase segmentation 噪声更大。\n32\t    Importance gradient 存在且单调递增，但从 s015→s020 的增幅仅 ~1.9×（vs MATH-500 的 ~3.1×）。 原因：GPQA\n33\t    问题的 token 分布在 phase 间更均匀（每个 phase 内的 segment 数远多于 MATH-500）， 稀释了低 sparsity phase\n34\t    的 vulnerability 集中效应。Gradient 数值在 [1.5, 2.0] 左右， 显著但不如 MATH-500 dramatic。\n35\t\n36\t    '\n37\t  tables:\n38\t  - title: GPQA DS Importance s020 Phase II\n39\t    rows:\n40\t    - phase: high\n41\t      median_ii: 0.035\n42\t      mean_ii: 0.22\n43\t      ci: '[0.09, 0.45]'\n44\t    - phase: mid\n45\t      median_ii: 0.28\n46\t      mean_ii: 1.15\n47\t      ci: '[0.85, 1.52]'\n48\t    - phase: low\n49\t      median_ii: 1.85\n50\t      mean_ii: 8.4\n51\t      ci: '[6.8, 10.3]'\n52\t  figures_description:\n53\t  - 'Phase gradient bar plot: 三 phase 的 median II 呈弱单调递增，error bars 较宽'\n54\t  analysis: 'Gradient 存在且统计显著，支持 phase-dependent severity 在 GPQA 上泛化。 但增幅弱于 MATH-500\n55\t    同 sparsity（MATH-500 s020 median_diff=1.48 vs GPQA 1.82， 表面看 GPQA 更大是因为绝对值基线不同；normalized\n56\t    后 GPQA scaling factor 更平坦）。 关键问题：这个 gradient 是否 importance-specific 取决于 random\n57\t    对照。\n58\t\n59\t    '\n60\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n61\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n62\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.25, 198 problems\n63\t  expected_results:\n64\t    n_problems: 198\n65\t    high_median_ii: 0.08\n66\t    mid_median_ii: 0.62\n67\t    low_median_ii: 2.85\n68\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 2.77\n69\t    ci_95:\n70\t    - 2.1\n71\t    - 3.5\n72\t    wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-35\n73\t    cohens_dz: 0.88\n74\t    monotonic: true\n75\t    low_high_ratio: 35.6\n76\t    dose_response_vs_s020: 2.77 vs 1.82 (1.52× increase)\n77\t  result_rationale: '继续单调递增但 marginal increase 递减（s020→s025 仅 1.52×，vs s015→s020 的\n78\t    1.9×）。 这与 MATH-500 的 sub-exponential growth 一致（C6 confirmed），但在 GPQA 上递减更快。 原因：GPQA\n79\t    的长推理链在高 sparsity 时进入 \"saturation regime\"——低 sparsity phase 的 perplexity 已经很高（可能\n80\t    >50），进一步增加 sparsity 的 marginal 破坏效果有限。 Ratio 35.6× 比 s015 的 75.2× 下降，说明 high phase\n81\t    的 II 也在上升（0.008→0.035→0.08）， three-way separation 在缩小。\n82\t\n83\t    '\n84\t  tables:\n85\t  - title: GPQA DS Importance s025 Phase II\n86\t    rows:\n87\t    - phase: high\n88\t      median_ii: 0.08\n89\t      mean_ii: 0.45\n90\t      ci: '[0.25, 0.72]'\n91\t    - phase: mid\n92\t      median_ii: 0.62\n93\t      mean_ii: 3.8\n94\t      ci: '[2.6, 5.2]'\n95\t    - phase: low\n96\t      median_ii: 2.85\n97\t      mean_ii: 15.2\n98\t      ci: '[11.5, 19.8]'\n99\t  figures_description:\n100\t  - 'Dose-response curve: s015→s025 gradient 增长曲线明显比 MATH-500 平坦'\n101\t  analysis: 'Phase gradient 稳健但 scaling 平坦。如果 random s025 也达到 ~1.5-2.0， imp/rand ratio\n102\t    仅 1.4-1.8×，无法支撑 \"importance-specific\" claim。\n103\t\n104\t    '\n105\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n106\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n107\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.30, 198 problems\n108\t  expected_results:\n109\t    n_problems: 198\n110\t    high_median_ii: 0.15\n111\t    mid_median_ii: 1.05\n112\t    low_median_ii: 3.45\n113\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 3.3\n114\t    ci_95:\n115\t    - 2.4\n116\t    - 4.0\n117\t    wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-38\n118\t    cohens_dz: 0.95\n119\t    monotonic: true\n120\t    low_high_ratio: 23.0\n121\t    dose_response_full: '0.95 → 1.82 → 2.77 → 3.30 (sub-exponential, Δ factors: 1.9×,\n122\t      1.52×, 1.19×)'\n123\t    growth_rate_decreasing: true\n124\t  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心指标：gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030 落在 [1.5,\n125\t    4.0] 范围内， 这里预测 3.30。比 MATH-500 的 8.48（n=500）或 14.59（n=50）弱得多。 原因有三：(1) GPQA 问题的推理链更长（平均\n126\t    6000+ tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200）， phase segmentation 的 signal-to-noise ratio 降低；(2)\n127\t    GPQA 是 multiple-choice 而非 open-ended generation，即使推理过程被严重扰乱，最终仍可能 \"猜中\" 正确选项， limiting\n128\t    the maximum compound interaction observable；(3) 在极高 sparsity 时 GPQA 进入 \"ceiling\n129\t    effect\"——所有 phase 都严重受损，phase 间差异被压缩。 s030 已接近 saturation，gradient 增幅仅 1.19×。\n130\t\n131\t    '\n132\t  tables:\n133\t  - title: GPQA DS Importance Dose-Response Summary\n134\t    rows:\n135\t    - sparsity: s015\n136\t      median_gradient: 0.95\n137\t      ci: '[0.89, 1.03]'\n138\t      dz: 0.814\n139\t    - sparsity: s020\n140\t      median_gradient: 1.82\n141\t      ci: '[1.45, 2.25]'\n142\t      dz: 0.72\n143\t    - sparsity: s025\n144\t      median_gradient: 2.77\n145\t      ci: '[2.1, 3.5]'\n146\t      dz: 0.88\n147\t    - sparsity: s030\n148\t      median_gradient: 3.3\n149\t      ci: '[2.4, 4.0]'\n150\t      dz: 0.95\n151\t  figures_description:\n152\t  - 'GPQA vs MATH-500 dose-response comparison: GPQA 曲线明显平坦，s030 仅为 MATH-500 的 39%'\n153\t  analysis: 'Dose-response 单调但 sub-exponential 且明显比 MATH-500 弱。 审稿人会指出：如果 gradient\n154\t    magnitude 是 task-dependent 且 GPQA 上 weak， 那 paper 的核心 claim 被限制为 \"on specific\n155\t    math benchmarks with medium-length chains\"。 结合 random 同样显示 gradient 的结果，specificity\n156\t    claim 被严重削弱。\n157\t\n158\t    '\n159\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n160\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n161\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.20, 198 problems\n162\t  expected_results:\n163\t    n_problems: 198\n164\t    high_median_ii: 0.025\n165\t    mid_median_ii: 0.22\n166\t    low_median_ii: 1.25\n167\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.2\n168\t    ci_95:\n169\t    - 0.85\n170\t    - 1.6\n171\t    wilcoxon_p: 4.7e-18\n172\t    cohens_dz: 0.52\n173\t    monotonic: true\n174\t    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 1.52\n175\t    comparison_math500_rand_s020: MATH-500 random s020 median_diff = -0.016 (NS);\n176\t      GPQA random s020 = 1.20 (p<1e-17)\n177\t  result_rationale: '这是 worst tier 的关键 negative 结果。GPQA random masking 在 s020 已产生\n178\t    显著且 non-trivial 的 phase gradient（d_z=0.52, medium effect）。 对比 MATH-500 random\n179\t    s020 完全 NS（median_diff=-0.016），GPQA random 的行为 qualitatively 不同。原因：GPQA 的长推理链（平均\n180\t    6000+ tokens）意味着 random eviction 在低 sparsity phase（reasoning-heavy）会移除更多 token\n181\t    （因为该 phase 有更多 token），造成的破坏本身就与 phase position 相关。 这是一个 trivial 的 \"longer phase\n182\t    = more tokens removed = more damage\" 效应， 不需要 scoring-specific mechanism 来解释。审稿人会认为\n183\t    GPQA 上 importance 和 random 的 gradient 只是 token count per phase 的函数， 而非 attention\n184\t    score discriminativeness 的证据。 Imp/rand ratio 仅 1.52×（远低于 MATH-500 的 15-17×），复现\n185\t    LLaMA 的模式（2.0-2.6×）。\n186\t\n187\t    '\n188\t  tables:\n189\t  - title: GPQA DS Random s020 Phase II\n190\t    rows:\n191\t    - phase: high\n192\t      median_ii: 0.025\n193\t      mean_ii: 0.18\n194\t      ci: '[0.05, 0.35]'\n195\t    - phase: mid\n196\t      median_ii: 0.22\n197\t      mean_ii: 0.85\n198\t      ci: '[0.45, 1.30]'\n199\t    - phase: low\n200\t      median_ii: 1.25\n201\t      mean_ii: 5.2\n202\t      ci: '[3.1, 7.8]'\n203\t  - title: Imp/Rand Ratio Cross-Benchmark\n204\t    rows:\n205\t    - benchmark: MATH-500 (DS)\n206\t      s020_ratio: ∞ (rand NS)\n207\t      s025_ratio: 15.5\n208\t      s030_ratio: 16.6\n209\t    - benchmark: GSM8K (DS)\n210\t      s020_ratio: 2.5\n211\t      s025_ratio: 3.8\n212\t      s030_ratio: 2.8\n213\t    - benchmark: GPQA (DS)\n214\t      s020_ratio: 1.52\n215\t      s025_ratio: ~1.6 (projected)\n216\t      s030_ratio: ~1.5 (projected)\n217\t  figures_description:\n218\t  - 'Three-way comparison: importance vs random phase gradient on GPQA，两条线几乎平行'\n219\t  analysis: '审稿人的核心攻击点：如果 GPQA random gradient 和 importance gradient 几乎一样强 （ratio\n220\t    1.5×），那 \"discrimination collapse\" 机制不是必要解释—— 任何 token removal 在长链上都产生 phase-dependent\n221\t    damage。 Phase gradient 可能只是 \"phase 内 token 数量\" 的 trivial 后果。 Reframe 需要论证：即使 ratio\n222\t    小，importance 仍然 consistently > random 跨所有条件，这是 \"discriminativeness scaling\" 而非\n223\t    absence of specificity。\n224\t\n225\t    '\n226\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n227\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n228\t  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25, 198 problems\n229\t  expected_results:\n230\t    n_problems: 198\n231\t    high_median_ii: 0.06\n232\t    mid_median_ii: 0.48\n233\t    low_median_ii: 1.95\n234\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.89\n235\t    ci_95:\n236\t    - 1.3\n237\t    - 2.5\n238\t    wilcoxon_p: 1.8e-22\n239\t    cohens_dz: 0.58\n240\t    monotonic: true\n241\t    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 1.47\n242\t    comparison_math500: MATH-500 random s025 median_diff=0.54 (significant but weak);\n243\t      GPQA random s025=1.89 (strong)\n244\t  result_rationale: 'Random gradient 继续增强，且 imp/rand ratio 进一步压缩到 1.47×。 注意在 MATH-500\n245\t    上 random s025 的 median_diff=0.54 已经 significant（D063 阈值效应）， 但远小于 importance 的\n246\t    7.16（ratio 13.2×）。在 GPQA 上这个 ratio 坍缩到 1.47×。 原因：GPQA 的长 context 使得 attention\n247\t    score 的 discriminativeness 本身就弱 （信息分散在更多 token 上），importance 和 random eviction\n248\t    的 \"effective difference\" 被 context length 稀释。这正是审稿人的 \"trivial\" 论点： 在足够长的 context\n249\t    上，importance scoring 不再提供相对于 random 的显著优势， 因此 importance-specific phase interaction\n250\t    的 claim 成为 benchmark-specific artifact。\n251\t\n252\t    '\n253\t  tables:\n254\t  - title: GPQA DS Random s025 Phase II\n255\t    rows:\n256\t    - phase: high\n257\t      median_ii: 0.06\n258\t      mean_ii: 0.35\n259\t      ci: '[0.15, 0.60]'\n260\t    - phase: mid\n261\t      median_ii: 0.48\n262\t      mean_ii: 2.1\n263\t      ci: '[1.2, 3.2]'\n264\t    - phase: low\n265\t      median_ii: 1.95\n266\t      mean_ii: 9.5\n267\t      ci: '[6.0, 13.5]'\n268\t  figures_description:\n269\t  - 'Imp vs Random gradient comparison at s025: bars nearly equal height'\n270\t  analysis: 'Ratio 1.47× 落在 worst tier 指定范围 [1.0, 2.0] 内。 审稿人结论：GPQA 数据表明 phase gradient\n271\t    不是 importance-specific 现象， 而是 token removal 在长推理链上的 universal phase-dependent\n272\t    effect。 Paper 必须放弃 \"qualitative dissociation\" claim，转向 \"quantitative scaling\"。\n273\t\n274\t    '\n275\t- name: gpqa_qw_importance_s015\n276\t  plan_id: gpqa_qw_importance_s015\n277\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.15, 198 problems\n278\t  expected_results:\n279\t    n_problems: 198\n280\t    high_median_ii: 0.003\n281\t    mid_median_ii: 0.025\n282\t    low_median_ii: 0.18\n283\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.177\n284\t    ci_95:\n285\t    - 0.12\n286\t    - 0.24\n287\t    wilcoxon_p: 2.3e-12\n288\t    cohens_dz: 0.45\n289\t    monotonic: true\n290\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen 在 MATH-500 上的 magnitude 约为 DeepSeek 的 1/4（已确认模式）。 GPQA 上预期同样的缩放：DS\n291\t    GPQA s015 gradient=0.95，QW ≈ 0.95/5.3 ≈ 0.18 （GPQA 上 Qwen 的 effective 推理链更短、更\n292\t    shallow，因为 Qwen 不是 reasoning-specialized model， 导致 phase gradient 更弱）。Phase gradient\n293\t    存在但效应量 medium-small (d_z=0.45)。 Onset threshold 可能与 MATH-500 相似（s≥0.15 barely\n294\t    significant）。\n295\t\n296\t    '\n297\t  tables:\n298\t  - title: GPQA QW Importance s015\n299\t    rows:\n300\t    - phase: high\n301\t      median_ii: 0.003\n302\t      mean_ii: 0.015\n303\t      ci: '[-0.005, 0.04]'\n304\t    - phase: mid\n305\t      median_ii: 0.025\n306\t      mean_ii: 0.12\n307\t      ci: '[0.06, 0.20]'\n308\t    - phase: low\n309\t      median_ii: 0.18\n310\t      mean_ii: 0.95\n311\t      ci: '[0.65, 1.30]'\n312\t  figures_description: []\n313\t  analysis: 'Qwen GPQA gradient 非常弱（0.177 vs DS 的 0.95），但仍统计显著。 问题在于这么小的效应量在审稿人看来是\n314\t    \"technically significant but practically irrelevant\"。\n315\t\n316\t    '\n317\t- name: gpqa_qw_importance_s020\n318\t  plan_id: gpqa_qw_importance_s020\n319\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.20, 198 problems\n320\t  expected_results:\n321\t    n_problems: 198\n322\t    high_median_ii: 0.008\n323\t    mid_median_ii: 0.065\n324\t    low_median_ii: 0.45\n325\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.442\n326\t    ci_95:\n327\t    - 0.3\n328\t    - 0.6\n329\t    wilcoxon_p: 5.1e-18\n330\t    cohens_dz: 0.55\n331\t    monotonic: true\n332\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen s020 继续增长（0.177→0.442, 2.5× factor），与 MATH-500 上 Qwen s015→s020\n333\t    的 增长模式一致（0.048→0.208, 4.3×）。GPQA 上增幅略弱是因为 Qwen 在 GPQA 任务上 推理链更短（非 reasoning-specialized），phase\n334\t    segmentation 的三段中 mid 段占比小， 导致 low/high 差异的 signal 被 within-phase variance 部分掩盖。\n335\t\n336\t    '\n337\t  tables:\n338\t  - title: GPQA QW Importance s020\n339\t    rows:\n340\t    - phase: high\n341\t      median_ii: 0.008\n342\t      mean_ii: 0.04\n343\t      ci: '[0.01, 0.08]'\n344\t    - phase: mid\n345\t      median_ii: 0.065\n346\t      mean_ii: 0.35\n347\t      ci: '[0.18, 0.55]'\n348\t    - phase: low\n349\t      median_ii: 0.45\n350\t      mean_ii: 2.1\n351\t      ci: '[1.4, 2.9]'\n352\t  figures_description: []\n353\t  analysis: 'Gradient 确认 Qwen 在 GPQA 上也有 phase modulation，但 magnitude 仅为 DS 的 ~1/4。\n354\t    Cross-model scaling 与 MATH-500 一致（QW/DS ratio ≈ 0.24）。\n355\t\n356\t    '\n357\t- name: gpqa_qw_importance_s025\n358\t  plan_id: gpqa_qw_importance_s025\n359\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.25, 198 problems\n360\t  expected_results:\n361\t    n_problems: 198\n362\t    high_median_ii: 0.02\n363\t    mid_median_ii: 0.15\n364\t    low_median_ii: 0.85\n365\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.83\n366\t    ci_95:\n367\t    - 0.55\n368\t    - 1.15\n369\t    wilcoxon_p: 1.2e-25\n370\t    cohens_dz: 0.68\n371\t    monotonic: true\n372\t  result_rationale: '继续 sub-exponential 增长（0.442→0.83, 1.88×）。Qwen 在 s025 效应量进入 medium-to-large\n373\t    范围，pattern 与 MATH-500 一致。但在 worst tier 下， 如果同时有 Qwen random GPQA 数据（即使没在当前 plan\n374\t    中）， 审稿人会 extrapolate LLaMA pattern 预期 ratio 同样 ≈1.5-2.0×。\n375\t\n376\t    '\n377\t  tables:\n378\t  - title: GPQA QW Importance s025\n379\t    rows:\n380\t    - phase: high\n381\t      median_ii: 0.02\n382\t      mean_ii: 0.12\n383\t      ci: '[0.05, 0.20]'\n384\t    - phase: mid\n385\t      median_ii: 0.15\n386\t      mean_ii: 0.75\n387\t      ci: '[0.45, 1.10]'\n388\t    - phase: low\n389\t      median_ii: 0.85\n390\t      mean_ii: 4.2\n391\t      ci: '[2.8, 5.8]'\n392\t  figures_description: []\n393\t  analysis: '在没有 Qwen random GPQA 对照的情况下，审稿人会引用 DS random GPQA 数据 论证 \"even on the\n394\t    same benchmark, random shows strong gradient\"。\n395\t\n396\t    '\n397\t- name: gpqa_qw_importance_s030\n398\t  plan_id: gpqa_qw_importance_s030\n399\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.30, 198 problems\n400\t  expected_results:\n401\t    n_problems: 198\n402\t    high_median_ii: 0.04\n403\t    mid_median_ii: 0.3\n404\t    low_median_ii: 1.35\n405\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.31\n406\t    ci_95:\n407\t    - 0.85\n408\t    - 1.8\n409\t    wilcoxon_p: 3.8e-30\n410\t    cohens_dz: 0.78\n411\t    monotonic: true\n412\t    qw_ds_ratio_gpqa_s030: 0.4\n413\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen s030 gradient 1.31 — 约为 DS s030（3.30）的 40%。 比 MATH-500 上的\n414\t    QW/DS ratio（3.155/8.48=37%）略高但在同一量级。 Cross-model scaling 跨 benchmark 一致（~35-40%）是\n415\t    positive signal， 但绝对值 1.31 太弱——审稿人会说 \"Qwen on GPQA shows a phase gradient indistinguishable\n416\t    from noise on any individual problem\"。 注意 worst tier gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030\n417\t    范围是 [1.5, 4.0]， 这里 Qwen 的 1.31 甚至低于下限——但该范围指的是 DS（primary model）。 Qwen 作为 cross-model\n418\t    replication 不需要单独达标。\n419\t\n420\t    '\n421\t  tables:\n422\t  - title: GPQA QW Full Dose-Response\n423\t    rows:\n424\t    - sparsity: s015\n425\t      gradient: 0.177\n426\t      dz: 0.45\n427\t    - sparsity: s020\n428\t      gradient: 0.442\n429\t      dz: 0.55\n430\t    - sparsity: s025\n431\t      gradient: 0.83\n432\t      dz: 0.68\n433\t    - sparsity: s030\n434\t      gradient: 1.31\n435\t      dz: 0.78\n436\t  figures_description:\n437\t  - QW GPQA dose-response 与 DS GPQA 并列，显示一致的单调递增但 magnitude ~40%\n438\t  analysis: 'Cross-model replication 方向一致，QW/DS ratio 跨 benchmark 稳定。 但问题是 Qwen magnitude\n439\t    太小，使得 \"practically meaningful\" 的论证困难。\n440\t\n441\t    '\n442\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030_projected\n443\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s030 (projected from s020+s025 pattern)\n444\t  description: 'Projected: DeepSeek GPQA random s=0.30 based on worst-tier scaling'\n445\t  expected_results:\n446\t    n_problems: 198\n447\t    high_median_ii: 0.1\n448\t    mid_median_ii: 0.75\n449\t    low_median_ii: 2.35\n450\t    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 2.25\n451\t    ci_95:\n452\t    - 1.5\n453\t    - 3.1\n454\t    wilcoxon_p: 5.0e-25\n455\t    cohens_dz: 0.62\n456\t    monotonic: true\n457\t    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 1.47\n458\t    cross_benchmark_ratio_comparison: 'MATH-500: 16.6×; GSM8K: 2.8×; GPQA: 1.47×'\n459\t  result_rationale: 'Random s030 gradient 投射为 ~2.25（基于 s020=1.20, s025=1.89 的增长趋势，\n460\t    factor 1.58×→1.19×，递减模式）。Imp/rand ratio 在 s030 为 3.30/2.25=1.47×。 这是 worst tier\n461\t    的核心 devastating 结果：GPQA 上 strategy specificity 几乎消失（ratio < 1.5×），与 LLaMA MATH-500（2.0-2.6×）相当甚至更弱。\n462\t    审稿人总结：\"The claimed importance-specificity is an artifact of short-to-medium math\n463\t    chains (MATH-500). On longer, more heterogeneous reasoning (GPQA), random eviction\n464\t    produces essentially the same phase-dependent pattern.\" 这迫使 reframe：paper 的贡献不再是\n465\t    \"importance eviction has unique phase interaction\"， 而是 \"all eviction methods show\n466\t    phase-dependent compound severity, with magnitude proportional to discriminativeness\"。\n467\t\n468\t    '\n469\t  tables:\n470\t  - title: GPQA Imp/Rand Ratio Across Sparsities (Worst Tier)\n471\t    rows:\n472\t    - sparsity: s020\n473\t      imp_gradient: 1.82\n474\t      rand_gradient: 1.2\n475\t      ratio: 1.52\n476\t    - sparsity: s025\n477\t      imp_gradient: 2.77\n478\t      rand_gradient: 1.89\n479\t      ratio: 1.47\n480\t    - sparsity: s030\n481\t      imp_gradient: 3.3\n482\t      rand_gradient: 2.25\n483\t      ratio: 1.47\n484\t  - title: Cross-Benchmark Strategy Specificity (DS, s030)\n485\t    rows:\n486\t    - benchmark: MATH-500\n487\t      imp_gradient: 8.48\n488\t      rand_gradient: 0.51\n489\t      ratio: 16.6×\n490\t    - benchmark: GSM8K\n491\t      imp_gradient: 4.68\n492\t      rand_gradient: 1.67\n493\t      ratio: 2.8×\n494\t    - benchmark: GPQA\n495\t      imp_gradient: 3.3\n496\t      rand_gradient: 2.25\n497\t      ratio: 1.47×\n498\t  figures_description:\n499\t  - Strategy specificity ratio 随 benchmark reasoning chain length 递减的 trend line\n500\t  - 'Scatter: chain length (x) vs imp/rand ratio (y)，negative correlation'\n501\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark specificity 模式清晰：MATH-500（短链） > GSM8K（中链） > GPQA（长链）。\n502\t    审稿人解读：importance 的 \"advantage\" over random 随 context length 递减， 因为在长 context 中\n503\t    attention score 的 discriminativeness 本身就降低 （信息分散、head attention pattern 更 uniform）。\n504\t    这支持 worst tier narrative：\"phase-dependent compound severity is universal; importance-specificity\n505\t    is a function of context length, not a fundamental property.\" Paper reframe 后的\n506\t    contribution 是量化这个 scaling law。\n507\t\n508\t    '\n509\t- name: recency_worst_tier_reinterpretation\n510\t  plan_id: C11 (recency reinterpretation under worst tier)\n511\t  description: Recency null results reinterpreted by reviewers as trivial temporal\n512\t    locality preservation\n513\t  expected_results:\n514\t    recency_s015_dz: 0.083\n515\t    recency_s025_dz: 0.22\n516\t    recency_s030_dz: -0.096\n517\t    all_NS: true\n518\t    max_dz: 0.22\n519\t    reviewer_interpretation: Recency preserves temporal locality → mild eviction for\n520\t      sequential reasoning → null is expected, not informative\n521\t  result_rationale: 'Recency 实验数据不变（已 confirmed），但审稿人的解读改变。 Worst tier 下审稿人认为：recency\n522\t    eviction 保留最近 token 本身就是对 sequential reasoning 最温和的策略（因为 reasoning chain 是从左到右构建的，最近\n523\t    token 包含 当前推理步骤）。因此 recency 的 null gradient 不是因为它 \"scoring-independent\" （从而排除\n524\t    scoring pathway confound），而是因为它作为 eviction 策略本身就弱 （eviction overlap with oracle\n525\t    高，即 recency 保留的 token 恰好是最重要的）。 如果 recency 的 token preservation 与 importance ranking\n526\t    高度重合， 那它不是有效的 negative control。审稿人要求：quantify eviction overlap between recency\n527\t    selection and importance ranking（如果 overlap > 70%， recency 就不是 \"independent\" control）。\n528\t    Worst tier 中 recency_max_dz_across_sparsities 在 [0.0, 0.15] 范围内 （s025 的 0.22 略超此范围但\n529\t    direction 反转 → 不支持 gradient hypothesis）。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t  tables:\n533\t  - title: Recency Control Results (Actual Data, Reviewer Reinterpretation)\n534\t    rows:\n535\t    - sparsity: s015\n536\t      dz: 0.083\n537\t      p: 0.77\n538\t      reviewer_note: NS — but expected if recency≈importance\n539\t    - sparsity: s025\n540\t      dz: 0.22\n541\t      p: 0.009\n542\t      reviewer_note: Barely significant, REVERSED direction\n543\t    - sparsity: s030\n544\t      dz: -0.096\n545\t      p: 0.114\n546\t      reviewer_note: NS, numerical instability\n547\t  figures_description: []\n548\t  analysis: '审稿人的 counter-argument：recency 不是有效 control 因为它 by construction preserves\n549\t    the most recent (and for reasoning, most critical) tokens。 需要补充 eviction overlap\n550\t    分析：计算 recency eviction set 与 importance bottom-k set 的 Jaccard overlap。如果 overlap\n551\t    低（<30%），control 有效； 如果 overlap 高（>60%），control 被 confound。 这是 worst tier 下需要额外实验（eviction\n552\t    overlap quantification）来 defend C11 的情况，但 deadline 前可能无法完成。\n553\t\n554\t    '\n555\t- name: reviewer_assessment_worst\n556\t  plan_id: overall_reviewer_simulation\n557\t  description: Simulated reviewer scores and key criticisms under worst tier\n558\t  expected_results:\n559\t    novelty_score: 2.5\n560\t    soundness_score: 3.0\n561\t    significance_score: 2.0\n562\t    overall_score: 2.75\n563\t    acceptance_probability: 0.15\n564\t    key_criticisms:\n565\t    - Phase gradient on GPQA is NOT importance-specific (ratio 1.5×). Core claim fails\n566\t      to generalize.\n567\t    - Recency control is confounded by temporal locality — not an independent control.\n568\t    - The 'discrimination collapse' mechanism is just restating 'pruning hurts quality'.\n569\t    - MATH-500 specificity (15-17×) appears to be a benchmark-specific artifact of\n570\t      medium chain lengths.\n571\t    - C5b mitigation failure + no practical contribution = purely descriptive paper\n572\t      with limited impact.\n573\t    recommended_decision: reject (borderline)\n574\t  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 审稿人 profile：一位 KV cache 方向的 expert reviewer 会直接指出\n575\t    GPQA random gradient 使 \"importance-specific\" claim 不成立。Novelty 从 \"qualitative\n576\t    dissociation\" 降为 \"quantitative observation\"，且观察本身可被 trivialized 为 \"longer reasoning\n577\t    chains are more fragile to any eviction\"。 Soundness 3.0（实验本身做得好，statistics 严谨），但\n578\t    significance 2.0 （无 practical method，无 clear actionable insight）。 Overall 2.75\n579\t    → borderline reject，acceptance probability 约 15%。 即使 reframe 成功（\"scaling law\"\n580\t    narrative），也需要 additional evidence： (1) eviction overlap quantification defending\n581\t    recency control， (2) explicit discriminativeness metric (e.g., oracle overlap)\n582\t    量化 importance vs random 的 eviction quality 差异作为 scaling law 的 x-axis。\n583\t\n584\t    '\n585\t  tables:\n586\t  - title: Projected Reviewer Scores (Worst Tier)\n587\t    rows:\n588\t    - criterion: Novelty\n589\t      score: 2.5\n590\t      note: quantitative, not qualitative\n591\t    - criterion: Soundness\n592\t      score: 3.0\n593\t      note: rigorous stats, proper controls\n594\t    - criterion: Significance\n595\t      score: 2.0\n596\t      note: no method, no clear utility\n597\t    - criterion: Clarity\n598\t      score: 3.5\n599\t      note: well-written if reframed\n600\t    - criterion: Overall\n601\t      score: 2.75\n602\t      note: borderline reject\n603\t  figures_description: []\n604\t  analysis: \"Reframe strategy under worst tier: (1) Title 改为 \\\"Phase-Dependent Compound\\\n605\t    \\ Severity Scales with Eviction Discriminativeness\\\" (2) 放弃 importance-specific\\\n606\t    \\ framing，embrace universality as the finding (3) 引入 eviction discriminativeness\\\n607\t    \\ 作为 quantitative predictor（oracle overlap metric） (4) 论证即使 universal，prior work\\\n608\t    \\ 从未量化 phase×strategy×sparsity 三维 interaction (5) Acknowledge GPQA ratio ~1.5×\\\n609\t    \\ honestly，但强调 monotonic ordering\\n    (importance > random > recency) 跨所有 benchmarks/architectures\\\n610\t    \\ 是 consistent\\n这仍然是 publishable contribution 但需要降低 novelty claim 的强度。\"\n611\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62fd4d67-76f6-455f-8ddb-c4e96d5fa66d","uuid":"3c5c7908-5c7b-4cad-b0a8-d54393b133aa","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:09:37.313Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T013445/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心贡献从 ''importance-specific phase interaction'' reframe 为 ''phase-dependent\n  compound severity is a universal phenomenon whose magnitude scales with eviction\n  method discriminativeness''。GPQA 结果证实 random 在长推理链 benchmark 上同样产生强 phase gradient（imp/rand\n  ratio ≈ 1.5-2.0×，复现 LLaMA 模式）， 审稿人认为这削弱了 \"importance-specific\" 的核心 claim。Recency\n  null 被解读为 recency 本身是温和策略（保留 temporal locality），而非证明 scoring-specificity。 新叙事：任何\n  non-trivial eviction 都产生 phase-dependent compound severity， severity magnitude 与\n  eviction discriminativeness 正相关（importance > random >> recency≈null）， 这是 quantitative\n  scaling law 而非 qualitative dissociation。 仍可投 EMNLP 但需重写 intro/framing，novelty claim\n  从 ''dissociation discovery'' 降为 ''scaling law quantification''。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.20, 198 problems, quantile\n    phase segmentation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.035\n    mid_median_ii: 0.28\n    low_median_ii: 1.85\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.82\n    ci_95:\n    - 1.45\n    - 2.25\n    wilcoxon_p: 3.2e-28\n    cohens_dz: 0.72\n    monotonic: true\n    low_high_ratio: 52.9\n    dose_response_vs_s015: 1.82 vs 0.95 (1.9× increase)\n  result_rationale: 'GPQA 的推理链比 MATH-500 更长且更异质（跨物理/化学/生物），phase segmentation 噪声更大。\n    Importance gradient 存在且单调递增，但从 s015→s020 的增幅仅 ~1.9×（vs MATH-500 的 ~3.1×）。 原因：GPQA\n    问题的 token 分布在 phase 间更均匀（每个 phase 内的 segment 数远多于 MATH-500）， 稀释了低 sparsity phase\n    的 vulnerability 集中效应。Gradient 数值在 [1.5, 2.0] 左右， 显著但不如 MATH-500 dramatic。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA DS Importance s020 Phase II\n    rows:\n    - phase: high\n      median_ii: 0.035\n      mean_ii: 0.22\n      ci: '[0.09, 0.45]'\n    - phase: mid\n      median_ii: 0.28\n      mean_ii: 1.15\n      ci: '[0.85, 1.52]'\n    - phase: low\n      median_ii: 1.85\n      mean_ii: 8.4\n      ci: '[6.8, 10.3]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Phase gradient bar plot: 三 phase 的 median II 呈弱单调递增，error bars 较宽'\n  analysis: 'Gradient 存在且统计显著，支持 phase-dependent severity 在 GPQA 上泛化。 但增幅弱于 MATH-500\n    同 sparsity（MATH-500 s020 median_diff=1.48 vs GPQA 1.82， 表面看 GPQA 更大是因为绝对值基线不同；normalized\n    后 GPQA scaling factor 更平坦）。 关键问题：这个 gradient 是否 importance-specific 取决于 random\n    对照。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.25, 198 problems\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.08\n    mid_median_ii: 0.62\n    low_median_ii: 2.85\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 2.77\n    ci_95:\n    - 2.1\n    - 3.5\n    wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-35\n    cohens_dz: 0.88\n    monotonic: true\n    low_high_ratio: 35.6\n    dose_response_vs_s020: 2.77 vs 1.82 (1.52× increase)\n  result_rationale: '继续单调递增但 marginal increase 递减（s020→s025 仅 1.52×，vs s015→s020 的\n    1.9×）。 这与 MATH-500 的 sub-exponential growth 一致（C6 confirmed），但在 GPQA 上递减更快。 原因：GPQA\n    的长推理链在高 sparsity 时进入 \"saturation regime\"——低 sparsity phase 的 perplexity 已经很高（可能\n    >50），进一步增加 sparsity 的 marginal 破坏效果有限。 Ratio 35.6× 比 s015 的 75.2× 下降，说明 high phase\n    的 II 也在上升（0.008→0.035→0.08）， three-way separation 在缩小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA DS Importance s025 Phase II\n    rows:\n    - phase: high\n      median_ii: 0.08\n      mean_ii: 0.45\n      ci: '[0.25, 0.72]'\n    - phase: mid\n      median_ii: 0.62\n      mean_ii: 3.8\n      ci: '[2.6, 5.2]'\n    - phase: low\n      median_ii: 2.85\n      mean_ii: 15.2\n      ci: '[11.5, 19.8]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dose-response curve: s015→s025 gradient 增长曲线明显比 MATH-500 平坦'\n  analysis: 'Phase gradient 稳健但 scaling 平坦。如果 random s025 也达到 ~1.5-2.0， imp/rand ratio\n    仅 1.4-1.8×，无法支撑 \"importance-specific\" claim。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.30, 198 problems\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.15\n    mid_median_ii: 1.05\n    low_median_ii: 3.45\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 3.3\n    ci_95:\n    - 2.4\n    - 4.0\n    wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-38\n    cohens_dz: 0.95\n    monotonic: true\n    low_high_ratio: 23.0\n    dose_response_full: '0.95 → 1.82 → 2.77 → 3.30 (sub-exponential, Δ factors: 1.9×,\n      1.52×, 1.19×)'\n    growth_rate_decreasing: true\n  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心指标：gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030 落在 [1.5,\n    4.0] 范围内， 这里预测 3.30。比 MATH-500 的 8.48（n=500）或 14.59（n=50）弱得多。 原因有三：(1) GPQA 问题的推理链更长（平均\n    6000+ tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200）， phase segmentation 的 signal-to-noise ratio 降低；(2)\n    GPQA 是 multiple-choice 而非 open-ended generation，即使推理过程被严重扰乱，最终仍可能 \"猜中\" 正确选项， limiting\n    the maximum compound interaction observable；(3) 在极高 sparsity 时 GPQA 进入 \"ceiling\n    effect\"——所有 phase 都严重受损，phase 间差异被压缩。 s030 已接近 saturation，gradient 增幅仅 1.19×。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA DS Importance Dose-Response Summary\n    rows:\n    - sparsity: s015\n      median_gradient: 0.95\n      ci: '[0.89, 1.03]'\n      dz: 0.814\n    - sparsity: s020\n      median_gradient: 1.82\n      ci: '[1.45, 2.25]'\n      dz: 0.72\n    - sparsity: s025\n      median_gradient: 2.77\n      ci: '[2.1, 3.5]'\n      dz: 0.88\n    - sparsity: s030\n      median_gradient: 3.3\n      ci: '[2.4, 4.0]'\n      dz: 0.95\n  figures_description:\n  - 'GPQA vs MATH-500 dose-response comparison: GPQA 曲线明显平坦，s030 仅为 MATH-500 的 39%'\n  analysis: 'Dose-response 单调但 sub-exponential 且明显比 MATH-500 弱。 审稿人会指出：如果 gradient\n    magnitude 是 task-dependent 且 GPQA 上 weak， 那 paper 的核心 claim 被限制为 \"on specific\n    math benchmarks with medium-length chains\"。 结合 random 同样显示 gradient 的结果，specificity\n    claim 被严重削弱。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.20, 198 problems\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.025\n    mid_median_ii: 0.22\n    low_median_ii: 1.25\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.2\n    ci_95:\n    - 0.85\n    - 1.6\n    wilcoxon_p: 4.7e-18\n    cohens_dz: 0.52\n    monotonic: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 1.52\n    comparison_math500_rand_s020: MATH-500 random s020 median_diff = -0.016 (NS);\n      GPQA random s020 = 1.20 (p<1e-17)\n  result_rationale: '这是 worst tier 的关键 negative 结果。GPQA random masking 在 s020 已产生\n    显著且 non-trivial 的 phase gradient（d_z=0.52, medium effect）。 对比 MATH-500 random\n    s020 完全 NS（median_diff=-0.016），GPQA random 的行为 qualitatively 不同。原因：GPQA 的长推理链（平均\n    6000+ tokens）意味着 random eviction 在低 sparsity phase（reasoning-heavy）会移除更多 token\n    （因为该 phase 有更多 token），造成的破坏本身就与 phase position 相关。 这是一个 trivial 的 \"longer phase\n    = more tokens removed = more damage\" 效应， 不需要 scoring-specific mechanism 来解释。审稿人会认为\n    GPQA 上 importance 和 random 的 gradient 只是 token count per phase 的函数， 而非 attention\n    score discriminativeness 的证据。 Imp/rand ratio 仅 1.52×（远低于 MATH-500 的 15-17×），复现\n    LLaMA 的模式（2.0-2.6×）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA DS Random s020 Phase II\n    rows:\n    - phase: high\n      median_ii: 0.025\n      mean_ii: 0.18\n      ci: '[0.05, 0.35]'\n    - phase: mid\n      median_ii: 0.22\n      mean_ii: 0.85\n      ci: '[0.45, 1.30]'\n    - phase: low\n      median_ii: 1.25\n      mean_ii: 5.2\n      ci: '[3.1, 7.8]'\n  - title: Imp/Rand Ratio Cross-Benchmark\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MATH-500 (DS)\n      s020_ratio: ∞ (rand NS)\n      s025_ratio: 15.5\n      s030_ratio: 16.6\n    - benchmark: GSM8K (DS)\n      s020_ratio: 2.5\n      s025_ratio: 3.8\n      s030_ratio: 2.8\n    - benchmark: GPQA (DS)\n      s020_ratio: 1.52\n      s025_ratio: ~1.6 (projected)\n      s030_ratio: ~1.5 (projected)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-way comparison: importance vs random phase gradient on GPQA，两条线几乎平行'\n  analysis: '审稿人的核心攻击点：如果 GPQA random gradient 和 importance gradient 几乎一样强 （ratio\n    1.5×），那 \"discrimination collapse\" 机制不是必要解释—— 任何 token removal 在长链上都产生 phase-dependent\n    damage。 Phase gradient 可能只是 \"phase 内 token 数量\" 的 trivial 后果。 Reframe 需要论证：即使 ratio\n    小，importance 仍然 consistently > random 跨所有条件，这是 \"discriminativeness scaling\" 而非\n    absence of specificity。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n  description: DeepSeek GPQA Diamond random masking s=0.25, 198 problems\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.06\n    mid_median_ii: 0.48\n    low_median_ii: 1.95\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.89\n    ci_95:\n    - 1.3\n    - 2.5\n    wilcoxon_p: 1.8e-22\n    cohens_dz: 0.58\n    monotonic: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 1.47\n    comparison_math500: MATH-500 random s025 median_diff=0.54 (significant but weak);\n      GPQA random s025=1.89 (strong)\n  result_rationale: 'Random gradient 继续增强，且 imp/rand ratio 进一步压缩到 1.47×。 注意在 MATH-500\n    上 random s025 的 median_diff=0.54 已经 significant（D063 阈值效应）， 但远小于 importance 的\n    7.16（ratio 13.2×）。在 GPQA 上这个 ratio 坍缩到 1.47×。 原因：GPQA 的长 context 使得 attention\n    score 的 discriminativeness 本身就弱 （信息分散在更多 token 上），importance 和 random eviction\n    的 \"effective difference\" 被 context length 稀释。这正是审稿人的 \"trivial\" 论点： 在足够长的 context\n    上，importance scoring 不再提供相对于 random 的显著优势， 因此 importance-specific phase interaction\n    的 claim 成为 benchmark-specific artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA DS Random s025 Phase II\n    rows:\n    - phase: high\n      median_ii: 0.06\n      mean_ii: 0.35\n      ci: '[0.15, 0.60]'\n    - phase: mid\n      median_ii: 0.48\n      mean_ii: 2.1\n      ci: '[1.2, 3.2]'\n    - phase: low\n      median_ii: 1.95\n      mean_ii: 9.5\n      ci: '[6.0, 13.5]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Imp vs Random gradient comparison at s025: bars nearly equal height'\n  analysis: 'Ratio 1.47× 落在 worst tier 指定范围 [1.0, 2.0] 内。 审稿人结论：GPQA 数据表明 phase gradient\n    不是 importance-specific 现象， 而是 token removal 在长推理链上的 universal phase-dependent\n    effect。 Paper 必须放弃 \"qualitative dissociation\" claim，转向 \"quantitative scaling\"。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_qw_importance_s015\n  plan_id: gpqa_qw_importance_s015\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.15, 198 problems\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.003\n    mid_median_ii: 0.025\n    low_median_ii: 0.18\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.177\n    ci_95:\n    - 0.12\n    - 0.24\n    wilcoxon_p: 2.3e-12\n    cohens_dz: 0.45\n    monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen 在 MATH-500 上的 magnitude 约为 DeepSeek 的 1/4（已确认模式）。 GPQA 上预期同样的缩放：DS\n    GPQA s015 gradient=0.95，QW ≈ 0.95/5.3 ≈ 0.18 （GPQA 上 Qwen 的 effective 推理链更短、更\n    shallow，因为 Qwen 不是 reasoning-specialized model， 导致 phase gradient 更弱）。Phase gradient\n    存在但效应量 medium-small (d_z=0.45)。 Onset threshold 可能与 MATH-500 相似（s≥0.15 barely\n    significant）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA QW Importance s015\n    rows:\n    - phase: high\n      median_ii: 0.003\n      mean_ii: 0.015\n      ci: '[-0.005, 0.04]'\n    - phase: mid\n      median_ii: 0.025\n      mean_ii: 0.12\n      ci: '[0.06, 0.20]'\n    - phase: low\n      median_ii: 0.18\n      mean_ii: 0.95\n      ci: '[0.65, 1.30]'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Qwen GPQA gradient 非常弱（0.177 vs DS 的 0.95），但仍统计显著。 问题在于这么小的效应量在审稿人看来是\n    \"technically significant but practically irrelevant\"。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_qw_importance_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_qw_importance_s020\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.20, 198 problems\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.008\n    mid_median_ii: 0.065\n    low_median_ii: 0.45\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.442\n    ci_95:\n    - 0.3\n    - 0.6\n    wilcoxon_p: 5.1e-18\n    cohens_dz: 0.55\n    monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen s020 继续增长（0.177→0.442, 2.5× factor），与 MATH-500 上 Qwen s015→s020\n    的 增长模式一致（0.048→0.208, 4.3×）。GPQA 上增幅略弱是因为 Qwen 在 GPQA 任务上 推理链更短（非 reasoning-specialized），phase\n    segmentation 的三段中 mid 段占比小， 导致 low/high 差异的 signal 被 within-phase variance 部分掩盖。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA QW Importance s020\n    rows:\n    - phase: high\n      median_ii: 0.008\n      mean_ii: 0.04\n      ci: '[0.01, 0.08]'\n    - phase: mid\n      median_ii: 0.065\n      mean_ii: 0.35\n      ci: '[0.18, 0.55]'\n    - phase: low\n      median_ii: 0.45\n      mean_ii: 2.1\n      ci: '[1.4, 2.9]'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Gradient 确认 Qwen 在 GPQA 上也有 phase modulation，但 magnitude 仅为 DS 的 ~1/4。\n    Cross-model scaling 与 MATH-500 一致（QW/DS ratio ≈ 0.24）。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_qw_importance_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_qw_importance_s025\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.25, 198 problems\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.02\n    mid_median_ii: 0.15\n    low_median_ii: 0.85\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.83\n    ci_95:\n    - 0.55\n    - 1.15\n    wilcoxon_p: 1.2e-25\n    cohens_dz: 0.68\n    monotonic: true\n  result_rationale: '继续 sub-exponential 增长（0.442→0.83, 1.88×）。Qwen 在 s025 效应量进入 medium-to-large\n    范围，pattern 与 MATH-500 一致。但在 worst tier 下， 如果同时有 Qwen random GPQA 数据（即使没在当前 plan\n    中）， 审稿人会 extrapolate LLaMA pattern 预期 ratio 同样 ≈1.5-2.0×。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA QW Importance s025\n    rows:\n    - phase: high\n      median_ii: 0.02\n      mean_ii: 0.12\n      ci: '[0.05, 0.20]'\n    - phase: mid\n      median_ii: 0.15\n      mean_ii: 0.75\n      ci: '[0.45, 1.10]'\n    - phase: low\n      median_ii: 0.85\n      mean_ii: 4.2\n      ci: '[2.8, 5.8]'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '在没有 Qwen random GPQA 对照的情况下，审稿人会引用 DS random GPQA 数据 论证 \"even on the\n    same benchmark, random shows strong gradient\"。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_qw_importance_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_qw_importance_s030\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B GPQA Diamond importance masking s=0.30, 198 problems\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.04\n    mid_median_ii: 0.3\n    low_median_ii: 1.35\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.31\n    ci_95:\n    - 0.85\n    - 1.8\n    wilcoxon_p: 3.8e-30\n    cohens_dz: 0.78\n    monotonic: true\n    qw_ds_ratio_gpqa_s030: 0.4\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen s030 gradient 1.31 — 约为 DS s030（3.30）的 40%。 比 MATH-500 上的\n    QW/DS ratio（3.155/8.48=37%）略高但在同一量级。 Cross-model scaling 跨 benchmark 一致（~35-40%）是\n    positive signal， 但绝对值 1.31 太弱——审稿人会说 \"Qwen on GPQA shows a phase gradient indistinguishable\n    from noise on any individual problem\"。 注意 worst tier gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030\n    范围是 [1.5, 4.0]， 这里 Qwen 的 1.31 甚至低于下限——但该范围指的是 DS（primary model）。 Qwen 作为 cross-model\n    replication 不需要单独达标。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA QW Full Dose-Response\n    rows:\n    - sparsity: s015\n      gradient: 0.177\n      dz: 0.45\n    - sparsity: s020\n      gradient: 0.442\n      dz: 0.55\n    - sparsity: s025\n      gradient: 0.83\n      dz: 0.68\n    - sparsity: s030\n      gradient: 1.31\n      dz: 0.78\n  figures_description:\n  - QW GPQA dose-response 与 DS GPQA 并列，显示一致的单调递增但 magnitude ~40%\n  analysis: 'Cross-model replication 方向一致，QW/DS ratio 跨 benchmark 稳定。 但问题是 Qwen magnitude\n    太小，使得 \"practically meaningful\" 的论证困难。\n\n    '\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030_projected\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s030 (projected from s020+s025 pattern)\n  description: 'Projected: DeepSeek GPQA random s=0.30 based on worst-tier scaling'\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.1\n    mid_median_ii: 0.75\n    low_median_ii: 2.35\n    median_gradient_low_minus_high: 2.25\n    ci_95:\n    - 1.5\n    - 3.1\n    wilcoxon_p: 5.0e-25\n    cohens_dz: 0.62\n    monotonic: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 1.47\n    cross_benchmark_ratio_comparison: 'MATH-500: 16.6×; GSM8K: 2.8×; GPQA: 1.47×'\n  result_rationale: 'Random s030 gradient 投射为 ~2.25（基于 s020=1.20, s025=1.89 的增长趋势，\n    factor 1.58×→1.19×，递减模式）。Imp/rand ratio 在 s030 为 3.30/2.25=1.47×。 这是 worst tier\n    的核心 devastating 结果：GPQA 上 strategy specificity 几乎消失（ratio < 1.5×），与 LLaMA MATH-500（2.0-2.6×）相当甚至更弱。\n    审稿人总结：\"The claimed importance-specificity is an artifact of short-to-medium math\n    chains (MATH-500). On longer, more heterogeneous reasoning (GPQA), random eviction\n    produces essentially the same phase-dependent pattern.\" 这迫使 reframe：paper 的贡献不再是\n    \"importance eviction has unique phase interaction\"， 而是 \"all eviction methods show\n    phase-dependent compound severity, with magnitude proportional to discriminativeness\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: GPQA Imp/Rand Ratio Across Sparsities (Worst Tier)\n    rows:\n    - sparsity: s020\n      imp_gradient: 1.82\n      rand_gradient: 1.2\n      ratio: 1.52\n    - sparsity: s025\n      imp_gradient: 2.77\n      rand_gradient: 1.89\n      ratio: 1.47\n    - sparsity: s030\n      imp_gradient: 3.3\n      rand_gradient: 2.25\n      ratio: 1.47\n  - title: Cross-Benchmark Strategy Specificity (DS, s030)\n    rows:\n    - benchmark: MATH-500\n      imp_gradient: 8.48\n      rand_gradient: 0.51\n      ratio: 16.6×\n    - benchmark: GSM8K\n      imp_gradient: 4.68\n      rand_gradient: 1.67\n      ratio: 2.8×\n    - benchmark: GPQA\n      imp_gradient: 3.3\n      rand_gradient: 2.25\n      ratio: 1.47×\n  figures_description:\n  - Strategy specificity ratio 随 benchmark reasoning chain length 递减的 trend line\n  - 'Scatter: chain length (x) vs imp/rand ratio (y)，negative correlation'\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark specificity 模式清晰：MATH-500（短链） > GSM8K（中链） > GPQA（长链）。\n    审稿人解读：importance 的 \"advantage\" over random 随 context length 递减， 因为在长 context 中\n    attention score 的 discriminativeness 本身就降低 （信息分散、head attention pattern 更 uniform）。\n    这支持 worst tier narrative：\"phase-dependent compound severity is universal; importance-specificity\n    is a function of context length, not a fundamental property.\" Paper reframe 后的\n    contribution 是量化这个 scaling law。\n\n    '\n- name: recency_worst_tier_reinterpretation\n  plan_id: C11 (recency reinterpretation under worst tier)\n  description: Recency null results reinterpreted by reviewers as trivial temporal\n    locality preservation\n  expected_results:\n    recency_s015_dz: 0.083\n    recency_s025_dz: 0.22\n    recency_s030_dz: -0.096\n    all_NS: true\n    max_dz: 0.22\n    reviewer_interpretation: Recency preserves temporal locality → mild eviction for\n      sequential reasoning → null is expected, not informative\n  result_rationale: 'Recency 实验数据不变（已 confirmed），但审稿人的解读改变。 Worst tier 下审稿人认为：recency\n    eviction 保留最近 token 本身就是对 sequential reasoning 最温和的策略（因为 reasoning chain 是从左到右构建的，最近\n    token 包含 当前推理步骤）。因此 recency 的 null gradient 不是因为它 \"scoring-independent\" （从而排除\n    scoring pathway confound），而是因为它作为 eviction 策略本身就弱 （eviction overlap with oracle\n    高，即 recency 保留的 token 恰好是最重要的）。 如果 recency 的 token preservation 与 importance ranking\n    高度重合， 那它不是有效的 negative control。审稿人要求：quantify eviction overlap between recency\n    selection and importance ranking（如果 overlap > 70%， recency 就不是 \"independent\" control）。\n    Worst tier 中 recency_max_dz_across_sparsities 在 [0.0, 0.15] 范围内 （s025 的 0.22 略超此范围但\n    direction 反转 → 不支持 gradient hypothesis）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Recency Control Results (Actual Data, Reviewer Reinterpretation)\n    rows:\n    - sparsity: s015\n      dz: 0.083\n      p: 0.77\n      reviewer_note: NS — but expected if recency≈importance\n    - sparsity: s025\n      dz: 0.22\n      p: 0.009\n      reviewer_note: Barely significant, REVERSED direction\n    - sparsity: s030\n      dz: -0.096\n      p: 0.114\n      reviewer_note: NS, numerical instability\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '审稿人的 counter-argument：recency 不是有效 control 因为它 by construction preserves\n    the most recent (and for reasoning, most critical) tokens。 需要补充 eviction overlap\n    分析：计算 recency eviction set 与 importance bottom-k set 的 Jaccard overlap。如果 overlap\n    低（<30%），control 有效； 如果 overlap 高（>60%），control 被 confound。 这是 worst tier 下需要额外实验（eviction\n    overlap quantification）来 defend C11 的情况，但 deadline 前可能无法完成。\n\n    '\n- name: reviewer_assessment_worst\n  plan_id: overall_reviewer_simulation\n  description: Simulated reviewer scores and key criticisms under worst tier\n  expected_results:\n    novelty_score: 2.5\n    soundness_score: 3.0\n    significance_score: 2.0\n    overall_score: 2.75\n    acceptance_probability: 0.15\n    key_criticisms:\n    - Phase gradient on GPQA is NOT importance-specific (ratio 1.5×). Core claim fails\n      to generalize.\n    - Recency control is confounded by temporal locality — not an independent control.\n    - The 'discrimination collapse' mechanism is just restating 'pruning hurts quality'.\n    - MATH-500 specificity (15-17×) appears to be a benchmark-specific artifact of\n      medium chain lengths.\n    - C5b mitigation failure + no practical contribution = purely descriptive paper\n      with limited impact.\n    recommended_decision: reject (borderline)\n  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 审稿人 profile：一位 KV cache 方向的 expert reviewer 会直接指出\n    GPQA random gradient 使 \"importance-specific\" claim 不成立。Novelty 从 \"qualitative\n    dissociation\" 降为 \"quantitative observation\"，且观察本身可被 trivialized 为 \"longer reasoning\n    chains are more fragile to any eviction\"。 Soundness 3.0（实验本身做得好，statistics 严谨），但\n    significance 2.0 （无 practical method，无 clear actionable insight）。 Overall 2.75\n    → borderline reject，acceptance probability 约 15%。 即使 reframe 成功（\"scaling law\"\n    narrative），也需要 additional evidence： (1) eviction overlap quantification defending\n    recency control， (2) explicit discriminativeness metric (e.g., oracle overlap)\n    量化 importance vs random 的 eviction quality 差异作为 scaling law 的 x-axis。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Projected Reviewer Scores (Worst Tier)\n    rows:\n    - criterion: Novelty\n      score: 2.5\n      note: quantitative, not qualitative\n    - criterion: Soundness\n      score: 3.0\n      note: rigorous stats, proper controls\n    - criterion: Significance\n      score: 2.0\n      note: no method, no clear utility\n    - criterion: Clarity\n      score: 3.5\n      note: well-written if reframed\n    - criterion: Overall\n      score: 2.75\n      note: borderline reject\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: \"Reframe strategy under worst tier: (1) Title 改为 \\\"Phase-Dependent Compound\\\n    \\ Severity Scales with Eviction Discriminativeness\\\" (2) 放弃 importance-specific\\\n    \\ framing，embrace universality as the finding (3) 引入 eviction discriminativeness\\\n    \\ 作为 quantitative predictor（oracle overlap metric） (4) 论证即使 universal，prior work\\\n    \\ 从未量化 phase×strategy×sparsity 三维 interaction (5) Acknowledge GPQA ratio ~1.5×\\\n    \\ honestly，但强调 monotonic ordering\\n    (importance > random > recency) 跨所有 benchmarks/architectures\\\n    \\ 是 consistent\\n这仍然是 publishable contribution 但需要降低 novelty claim 的强度。\"\n","numLines":611,"startLine":1,"totalLines":611}}}
