{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LRPCp1HxRM8B2obGDLDVNP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/literature_map.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"## Literature Map — Phase-Gated Compound Sparsity\\\\n## 增量扫描: 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# 已知文献（baseline）\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: spark-aaai2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"SparK: Query-Aware Unstructured Sparsity with Recoverable KV Cache Channel Pruning\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: AAAI 2026\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: direct-competitor\\\\n  relevance: 首篇报告 compound sparsity 总是 super-additive（ThinK+SnapKV 退化 65%），核心对标\\\\n  key_finding: compound KV cache sparsity (channel + token) 产生 super-additive degradation\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: thinkv-iclr2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"ThinKV\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: ICLR 2026 Oral\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: phase 划分思想来源，但只做单一压缩策略\\\\n  key_finding: KV cache 可按 phase 划分应用不同策略\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: rac-neurips2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"RAC\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: NeurIPS 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: reasoning model 对 sparsity 更敏感，支撑评估任务选择\\\\n  key_finding: reasoning model 对 sparsity 敏感度高于一般 LLM\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: raas-acl2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"RaaS\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: ACL 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: milestone tokens 先重要后衰减，支撑 phase-dependent importance\\\\n  key_finding: token importance 随 decoding phase 非单调变化\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: mixeddimkv-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"MixedDimKV\\\\\\\"\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: multi-dimension compression budget allocation，与 joint controller 思路平行\\\\n  key_finding: 多维度压缩 budget allocation 优于均匀分配\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# 新增 — Compound / Joint Compression Interaction\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: slim-icml2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"SLiM: One-shot Quantization and Sparsity with Low-rank Approximation for LLM Weight Compression\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: Mozaffari et al.\\\\n  venue: ICML 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: 首个正式处理 compound compression error 的框架——用 low-rank adapter 补偿 Q+S 聚合误差，证明误差非加性\\\\n  key_finding: quantization + sparsity 聚合误差非加性；invertible saliency function 精确计算 low-rank 补偿\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: unicomp-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"UniComp: A Unified Evaluation of Large Language Model Compression via Pruning, Quantization and Distillation\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: Wang et al.\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2602.09130\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: evaluation\\\\n  relevance: 40+ benchmarks 系统评估 compound compression，发现 compression 有 consistent knowledge bias\\\\n  key_finding: compression 对 knowledge-intensive tasks 保留好但 reasoning/multilingual 显著退化；quantization 整体 trade-off 最佳\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: compression-ordering-2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"A Systematic Study of Compression Ordering for Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2511.19495\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: 证明 compound compression ordering 显著影响结果，early quantization 造成不可逆信息损失\\\\n  key_finding: P→KD→Q 最优；quantization first 产生不可逆退化；interaction 依赖 ordering\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: phase-transition-compression-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Phase Transitions in Large Language Model Compression\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: Ma et al.\\\\n  venue: npj Artificial Intelligence (Nature), 2026\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: 直接支撑 phase-gating 理论动机——不同压缩维度有独立 phase transition point，联合安全区可叠加\\\\n  key_finding: structured pruning 30-45% 崩溃，unstructured 55-65%；多维度 PTP 正交，联合安全区可实现 10% 压缩\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: graspune-acl2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"GRASPrune: Global Gating for Budgeted Structured Pruning of Large Language Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: Wang et al.\\\\n  venue: ACL 2026 Main\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: direct-competitor\\\\n  relevance: 最直接 competitor——联合 pruning FFN channels + KV head groups with learned gate scores under global budget\\\\n  key_finding: learned gate + projected STE 全局 budget 下联合 prune FFN+heads，高压缩比下显著优于逐层独立 pruning\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: mustafar-neurips2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"MUSTAFAR: Promoting Unstructured Sparsity for KV Cache Pruning in LLM Inference\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: Joo et al.\\\\n  venue: NeurIPS 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: per-token magnitude pruning 70% sparsity 无损，与 token eviction 可组合——potential compound baseline\\\\n  key_finding: unstructured KV sparsity (per-token magnitude) 70% 无损，bitmap 格式 2.23x throughput\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# 新增 — Non-monotonic / Sign Reversal / Phase Effects\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: decision-repr-transition-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Understanding Performance Collapse in Layer-Pruned LLMs via Decision Representation Transitions\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2605.07271\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: layer pruning 存在 Silent/Decisive Phase 二分——pruning 敏感度 phase-dependent，直接支撑 phase-gated 思想\\\\n  key_finding: Decision Margin 在 Transition Point 发生符号反转（负→正）；pruning Silent Phase 崩溃，Decisive Phase 可安全 prune\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: doing-more-with-less-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Doing More With Less: Revisiting the Effectiveness of LLM Pruning for Test-Time Scaling\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2604.25098\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: 符号反转直接证据——unstructured pruning + TTS 可超越未剪枝模型\\\\n  key_finding: unstructured pruning + test-time scaling 可超越 unpruned baseline（Qwen3-8B）；structured pruning 严重退化\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: sparse-frontier-2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"The Sparse Frontier: Sparse Attention Trade-offs in Transformer LLMs\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2504.17768\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: evaluation\\\\n  relevance: 最大规模 sparse attention 评估，无通用最优策略，trade-off 依赖 task 和 phase\\\\n  key_finding: decoding vs prefilling 可承受 sparsity 不同；大模型+高稀疏可优于小模型+密集\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# 新增 — Adaptive / Learned Controllers\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: obcache-2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"OBCache: Optimal Brain KV Cache Pruning for Efficient Long-Context LLM Inference\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2510.07651\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: OBD 理论推导 joint K-V saliency score，可作为 importance-based masking 的理论参照\\\\n  key_finding: 二阶 Taylor 近似推导 joint K-V pruning score；key-pruning 比 value-pruning 影响更大\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: pagedeviction-eacl2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"PagedEviction: Structured Block-wise KV Cache Pruning\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: EACL 2026 Findings\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: prefill/decode 两阶段不同 eviction 策略，呼应 phase-gated 思想\\\\n  key_finding: block-wise eviction prefill/decode 分阶段执行，优于 token-level baselines\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: adakv-neurips2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Ada-KV: Adaptive Budget Allocation for KV Cache Eviction\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: NeurIPS 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: per-head adaptive budget 分配，与 per-phase budget allocation 正交互补\\\\n  key_finding: 自适应 per-head KV cache budget 优于均匀分配\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: sol-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"SOL: Self-Optimizing Language Models — Compute Where it Counts\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2605.10875\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: learned policy 按 token difficulty 分配 compute，与 learned joint controller 方法论平行\\\\n  key_finding: 学习 per-token compute allocation policy，easy tokens 少算 hard tokens 多算\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# 新增 — Phase-Adaptive Dynamic Compression (2026-05-14 scan)\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: twilight-neurips2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Twilight: Adaptive Attention Sparsity with Hierarchical Top-p Pruning\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: Lin, Tang, Yang, Wang, Tang, Tian, Stoica, Han, Gao\\\\n  venue: NeurIPS 2025 Spotlight\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: 证明 fixed budget 次优，per-step adaptive budget 更优；但单轴无 compound interaction\\\\n  key_finding: top-p 采样思想做 per-step adaptive attention budget，最多 prune 98% tokens\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: lava-emnlp2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"LAVa: Layer-wise KV Cache Eviction with Dynamic Budget Allocation\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: Shen, Yuan, Zhang, Wang, Jiang, Nguyen\\\\n  venue: EMNLP 2025 Findings\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: layer budgets 对 generation 重要、head budgets 对 extraction 重要——支撑 task-conditional budget\\\\n  key_finding: 基于 Layer Attention Output Loss 的 unified eviction + dynamic budget；budget 需求 task-dependent\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: lkv-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"LKV: End-to-End Learning of Head-wise Budgets and Token Selection for LLM KV Cache Eviction\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2605.06676\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: 首个端到端可微 budget+selection 联合学习框架；可作 phase-gated controller backbone\\\\n  key_finding: LKV-H 学 head budget + LKV-T 学 token selection，全面超越启发式方法\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: defensivekv-iclr2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"DefensiveKV: Taming the Fragility of KV Cache Eviction in LLM Inference\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: ICLR 2026\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: direct-competitor\\\\n  relevance: 独立发现 importance-based eviction 的脆弱性——stability assumption 不成立，importance 高度非稳态\\\\n  key_finding: mean aggregation 在极端情况下 vulnerable；defensive aggregation 控制 worst-case risk，2.3-4.3x 质量损失降低\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: retentivekv-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"RetentiveKV: State-Space Memory for Uncertainty-Aware Multimodal KV Cache Eviction\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2605.04075\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: \\\\\\\"Deferred Importance\\\\\\\" 现象——token 初始 salience 低但后期变 pivotal，直接支撑 crossover 机制\\\\n  key_finding: 视觉 tokens 存在 deferred importance——早期不重要晚期关键；单一时刻 importance 评估不可靠\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: pitfalls-kvcache-2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2510.00231\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: multi-instruction 场景下部分指令被压缩严重忽略——condition-dependent failure\\\\n  key_finding: 特定 instructions 在压缩下退化极快甚至完全被忽略；compression method + order 产生 bias 交互\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: greedy-bias-kvcache-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"More Than a Quick Glance: Overcoming the Greedy Bias in KV-Cache Compression\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2602.02199\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: 单一 attention-score metric 是 greedy 的——miss structurally relevant tokens\\\\n  key_finding: 单 metric 有 greedy bias；multi-metric scoring 克服 condition-dependent metric failure\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: thinking-tokens-mi-neurips2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Demystifying Reasoning Dynamics with Mutual Information: Thinking Tokens are Information Peaks\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: NeurIPS 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: reasoning 中 MI 在 thinking tokens 处突然 peak——compression 需避开 info-critical phases\\\\n  key_finding: thinking tokens (Hmm/Wait/Therefore) 处 MI 突增；这些 tokens 对推理性能不成比例重要\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: lserve-mlsys2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"LServe: Efficient Long-sequence LLM Serving with Unified Sparse Attention\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: MLSys 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: sparse attention + KV quantization 工业级联合部署但无 interaction 分析\\\\n  key_finding: 统一 static/dynamic sparsity + KV quant 到单 GPU kernel；prefilling 2.9x 加速\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: squeezeattention-iclr2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"SqueezeAttention: 2D Management of KV-Cache via Layer-wise Optimal Budget\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: ICLR 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: layer × sequence 二维 budget 优化；我们增加第三维——temporal phase\\\\n  key_finding: layer-wise cosine similarity 区分 layer 重要性，30-70% memory reduction\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: nsa-acl2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"NSA: Native Sparse Attention\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: DeepSeek\\\\n  venue: ACL 2025 Best Paper\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: hardware-aligned trainable sparse attention；hierarchical 策略（coarse compression + fine selection）呼应 multi-phase\\\\n  key_finding: 端到端可训练 sparse attention，64k 解码 11.6x 加速；coarse+fine 分层策略\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: evicpress-2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"EVICPRESS: Joint KV-Cache Compression and Eviction for Efficient LLM Serving\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2512.14946\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: 联合 eviction + quantization 优化 KV cache——compound 方向但仅 KV 内部\\\\n  key_finding: joint eviction + quantization 优于独立应用；但无 head pruning compound\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: phase-transition-pruning-thermo-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Phase Transitions in Neural Networks Pruning (Thermodynamic Analysis)\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2602.15224\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: 自由能分析预测 sharp collapse；transition 前稳定 3-5%，跨越后 30%+ 骤降\\\\n  key_finding: free-energy phase transition 预测 pruning 崩溃点；importance 方法可能在某 phase 跨越 PTP\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: token-budget-aware-acl2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Token-Budget-Aware LLM Reasoning\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: ACL 2025 Findings\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: reasoning budget 应按 query 难度自适应分配——支撑 phase-adaptive compression\\\\n  key_finding: self-consistency 作为 thinking necessity proxy 动态调整 reasoning token budget\\\\n\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n# 新增 — C5b Negative Result 文献联动 (2026-05-14)\\\\n# ============================================================\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: physics-kvcache-2026\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"Understanding the Physics of Key-Value Cache Compression for LLMs through Attention Dynamics\\\\\\\"\\\\n  venue: arXiv 2603.01426\\\\n  year: 2026\\\\n  category: background\\\\n  relevance: 直接解释 C5b negative——representational rigidity 使 budget redistribution 无法修复 routing collapse；90% 附近存在 sharp hallucination cliff (phase transition)\\\\n  key_finding: head-level consensus 过度导致 representational rigidity，token 存活但 routing flexibility 崩溃；compression 存在 sharp safety cliff 对应 semantic reachability phase transition\\\\n\\\\n- paper_id: rkv-neurips2025\\\\n  title: \\\\\\\"R-KV: Redundancy-aware KV Cache Compression for Reasoning Models\\\\\\\"\\\\n  authors: Cai et al.\\\\n  venue: NeurIPS 2025\\\\n  year: 2025\\\\n  category: method-component\\\\n  relevance: reasoning model 专用单轴 KV compression，10% cache 保留 ~100% 性能；但不涉及 compound interaction，与 C5b failure 机制不直接相关\\\\n  key_finding: importance + non-redundancy 双准则 token ranking，10% KV cache 保留全精度性能；单轴方法无 compound 讨论\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 13069, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01J4pP2fv52w1uazqx3vZsWR","session_id":"62fd4d67-76f6-455f-8ddb-c4e96d5fa66d","uuid":"a1c22023-721f-4576-ac2c-8ed2b70f0599","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:11:00.707Z"}
